1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:53,170
400 years ago

25
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:59,810
All the Nascent Soul leaders of Zhao have arrived.

26
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,770
Greetings Envoy.

27
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,050
Everyone,

28
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:08,010
the country of Zhao has been stuck at rank 3 for too long.

29
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:11,890
We need a talented cultivator who can grow quickly

30
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:15,010
and reach the level of Soul Formation.

31
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:16,810
If our plan succeeds

32
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:20,290
the country of Zhao will become a rank 4 cultivation country.

33
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:21,290
Grow quickly ?

34
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,810
Lord Envoy, you are brillant.

35
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,850
This could be our chance.

36
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,890
Lord Envoy,

37
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:29,810
may I ask what kind of plan you have ?

38
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:34,130
We just need to gather all the Spirit Roots of Zhao

39
00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:37,770
and feed this endless unused spiritual energy

40
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:40,490
to a single talented individual.

41
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:42,810
It can speed up the cultivation

42
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,850
so that one can reach Soul Formation.

43
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:46,530
This...

44
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:48,210
Taking the Spirit Roots of the mortals ?

45
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:51,090
Cultivators should not interfere with the lives of mortals.

46
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:52,850
I'm afraid...

47
00:02:52,810 --> 00:02:55,140
The Ancestors will make the right decision.

48
00:02:57,040 --> 00:03:00,410
Everything is ready, we should seize this opportunity.

49
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:03,130
I gathered you here today

50
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:07,370
to decide who that talented person will be.

51
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,210
Lord Envoy,

52
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:10,450
If mortals lose their Spirit Roots,

53
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:12,090
they will lose the ability to cultivate

54
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:15,410
and our sects of Zhao will not have any new disiples...

55
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:17,970
This will be the last generation of cultivators.

56
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:20,250
Envoy, please think twice about it.

57
00:03:20,010 --> 00:03:22,740
Envoy, please think twice about it.

58
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:25,970
Think twice ?

59
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:32,170
Lord Envoy, calm down.

60
00:03:32,790 --> 00:03:36,210
It's fellow cultivators that need to think twice.

61
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:38,210
This plan

62
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:40,610
will not destroy the mortal world.

63
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:43,290
If the Country of Zhao reaches rank 4

64
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:45,650
the availability of ressources will increase.

65
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:49,930
The spiritual energy from the Spirit Roots will be returned to the mortals.

66
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:52,770
There is no need to worry about the next generation.

67
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:55,250
Lord Envoy,

68
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:58,250
my Teng Family is the top cultivation family in Zhao.

69
00:03:58,440 --> 00:04:00,930
We have many talented individuals.

70
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:02,560
The Teng Family

71
00:04:02,330 --> 00:04:06,650
has already formed cultivation pairs with geniuses of many sects.

72
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,490
We have power all over Zhao,

73
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:12,890
we can quickly set up formations in the Spirit Veins everywhere

74
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:15,090
and gather the Spirit Roots.

75
00:04:15,090 --> 00:04:18,890
My Teng Family is definitely be the best choice for this plan.

76
00:04:18,910 --> 00:04:19,850
Good.

77
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:23,090
I have put the Spirit Gathering Formation in this jade.

78
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,420
When your Teng Family is ready,

79
00:04:25,190 --> 00:04:27,130
you can start extracting the Spirit Roots.

80
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:31,250
I will choose the lucky one from your Teng Family.

81
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,730
Thank you Lord Envoy,

82
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:35,050
the Teng Family will not disappoint you !

83
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:37,930
Piao Nanzi,

84
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:40,010
your Xuan Dao Sect

85
00:04:39,760 --> 00:04:42,650
doesn't need to go to the Foreign Battelfield this time.

86
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:45,290
From now on, your Xuan Dao Sect

87
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:48,530
will provide assistance to the Teng Family.

88
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:49,810
Understood...

89
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:51,410
Lord Envoy...

90
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,610
Brother Piao,

91
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,810
if I die here

92
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:04,690
Lord Envoy will not let you live either.

93
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:07,290
If it weren't for Lord Envoy's order,

94
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:10,690
do you think I would protect your Teng Family ?

95
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:10,810
Piao Nanzi
Xuan Dao Sect Leader
Late stage Nascent Soul

96
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:13,050
Do you think you can protect him alone ?

97
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,090
Who are you ?

98
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:16,540
You !

99
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:20,010
Teng Huayuan !

100
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:22,330
Do you dare to fight me ?

101
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:28,010
It's you !

102
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:31,290
It turns out he grew to such a level...

103
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:38,930
Break !

104
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:56,010
Not gonna die ?

105
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:08,050
Since you're able to block this attack,

106
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:10,810
Piao Nanzi, you're indeed the top expert of Zhao.

107
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:14,130
I want to see

108
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:17,130
how long you will last.

109
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,290
For 400 years,

110
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:24,660
Lin Yi, the Envoy of Heaven's Tower

111
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:28,530
interfered with the development of Zhao.

112
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:30,770
To save my Xuan Dao Sect,

113
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:32,850
I had to collude with the Teng Family.

114
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:34,610
Now the country of Zhao

115
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,770
is in a state of chaos

116
00:07:36,520 --> 00:07:39,130
and the mortal world is collapsing...

117
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:43,530
Yet I must help the wicked to destroy Zhao...

118
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:02,410
Greetings Lord Envoy.

119
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:04,890
Since you uprooted my hundred years old plan,

120
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:06,610
you deserve to die.

121
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:07,970
However,

122
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:10,210
if you hand over the Heaven Defying Bead,

123
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:12,130
I will spare your life

124
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:14,450
and let you use the Spirit Veins.

125
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,810
How does it sound ?

126
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:17,050
Lord Envoy !

127
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,780
I said that

128
00:08:18,540 --> 00:08:20,570
those who help Teng Huayuan

129
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:22,130
must die !

130
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:45,050
You have good spells

131
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:47,170
but compared to me

132
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:49,610
you are insignificant.

133
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,490
Little brat,

134
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:21,010
you will regret this.

135
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:30,650
I have been waiting for this for a long time !

136
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:36,290
Divine Retribution ?

137
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:03,730
Take my place !

138
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:05,290
Consider it an honor.

139
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,450
Burning your lifespan ?

140
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,810
What are you doing ?!

141
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:13,850
Now that it has come to this, you want to escape ?

142
00:10:14,160 --> 00:10:17,890
Do you think the mortals of Zhao will agree ?

143
00:10:17,640 --> 00:10:19,050
What the hell are you talking about ?

144
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:21,410
I am the Envoy of Heaven's Tower !

145
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:28,050
I was able to hold you back enough...

146
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:32,690
I am satisfied...

147
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:03,170
I calculated everything...

148
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:06,410
But I never expected the Teng Family

149
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:11,290
could be destroyed by a small fry like you !

150
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:15,570
It's ridiculous...

151
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:28,850
Don't be so presomptuous.

152
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:31,210
Look !

153
00:11:31,680 --> 00:11:34,410
You are the one who sacrified them.

154
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:37,010
Their souls are leaving their bodies

155
00:11:36,760 --> 00:11:41,360
because you killed them with your own hands.

156
00:11:41,130 --> 00:11:43,330
You forced me to !

157
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:44,890
Wang Lin,

158
00:11:44,880 --> 00:11:46,490
I curse you

159
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:48,250
to die alone,

160
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:50,170
to have a terrible death !

161
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,410
Teng Huanyuan,

162
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:55,250
how did you find my hometown ?

163
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:58,610
You will never know.

164
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:16,610
Not willing to talk ?

165
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,770
I will.

166
00:12:21,560 --> 00:12:23,810
Gao Qiming from the Piao Miao Sect

167
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:27,930
helped me find your family using his divination spells.

168
00:12:28,410 --> 00:12:29,930
Gao Qiming...

169
00:12:31,400 --> 00:12:32,970
I will remember this name.

170
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:38,690
You...

171
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:41,010
can go to hell.

172
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:47,370
Gao Qiming
Piao Miao Sect Leader
Late stage Nascent Soul

173
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:05,650
A memory formation ?

174
00:14:15,760 --> 00:14:17,370
400 years ago,

175
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:19,650
I was asked by Teng Huayuan

176
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:24,410
to find the hometown of a Foundation Establishment cultivator.

177
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:26,480
It caused a great disaster.

178
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:30,130
But I protected the bloodline of Wang Tiantu, your family.

179
00:14:30,760 --> 00:14:32,810
I believe in the heaven and earth

180
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:36,410
and in the cycle of cause and effect.

181
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:39,250
As I have forseen, I will die today.

182
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:43,170
Please don't involve the Piao Miao Sect.

183
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:06,130
Father...

184
00:15:06,520 --> 00:15:07,450
Mother...

185
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,370
I have avenged you.

186
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:13,610
I will now embark on my own path.

187
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:23,010
Senior Situ,

188
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:25,570
the day I reach Soul Transformation

189
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,770
is the day you will awaken

190
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:29,730
and regain your freedom.

191
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:44,650
Dear, Tie Zhu,

192
00:15:44,560 --> 00:15:45,770
let's eat.

193
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:10,890
400 years

194
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,730
passed in the blink of an eye.

195
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:16,250
When I was young, I wanted my parents to be respected

196
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:18,450
so I stepped in the cultivation world.

197
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:20,810
Unexpectedly, mortal and Immortal are separated.

198
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:23,090
To get my revenge,

199
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:25,290
I had to kill my way through

200
00:16:25,520 --> 00:16:27,410
and force myself to get stronger.

201
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:30,320
Now that my revenge is done,

202
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:32,280
I can leave this place

203
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:34,170
to explore this vast universe

204
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:35,640
that is brimming with life.

205
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:38,970
I, Wang Lin, will never stop growing.

206
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:41,410
I will defy the heavens.

207
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:44,010
No matter how difficult the journey is,

208
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:46,410
I will forge my own path.

209
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:48,370
That's because...

210
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:50,570
if my cultivation is not high enough,

211
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:53,290
I cannot protect the people that are important to me.

212
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:58,170
My son, it doesn't matter if you are not chosen.

213
00:16:58,520 --> 00:17:00,330
You can always come back,

214
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:02,290
we will always be there for you.

215
00:17:02,760 --> 00:17:04,560
Tie Zhu...

216
00:17:05,320 --> 00:17:08,050
you look like an Immortal now.

217
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:11,570
I have never been so proud in my life.

218
00:17:11,600 --> 00:17:13,370
From now on, I will teach you cultivation.

219
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:16,450
Focus your mind on your breathing !

220
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:18,650
I want to stay in the Cloud Sky Sect.

221
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:21,990
Only here do I have the right conditions to try to refine grade 6 pills.

222
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:23,690
That way I can be useful to you in the future.

223
00:17:34,180 --> 00:19:50,030
I guess it's about time to tell you that the whole subplot of the Spirit Veins is donghua original. I think it was added to dilute Wang Lin's genocide of the Teng Family. In the novel he just killed every single one of them in cold blood (except Teng Xiuxiu).

Another way they dilute Wang Lin's actions is by making Teng Huayuan use the Reverse Formation to kill his family himself to get stronger. None of that happens in the novel, just a pure massacre.

224
00:17:42,490 --> 00:17:46,620
I've had my share of wounds,

225
00:17:44,530 --> 00:17:46,620
now I want to fight back.

226
00:17:46,450 --> 00:17:50,180
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

227
00:17:50,010 --> 00:17:56,100
that's blocking all my hopes

228
00:17:52,890 --> 00:17:56,100
for life ?

229
00:17:57,650 --> 00:18:01,860
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

230
00:17:59,370 --> 00:18:01,860
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

231
00:18:01,930 --> 00:18:05,260
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

232
00:18:05,370 --> 00:18:11,260
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

233
00:18:08,090 --> 00:18:11,260
out of reach.

234
00:18:12,370 --> 00:18:16,740
Immortals

235
00:18:13,410 --> 00:18:16,740
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

236
00:18:16,770 --> 00:18:20,780
Renegades

237
00:18:17,530 --> 00:18:20,780
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

238
00:18:20,530 --> 00:18:24,620
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

239
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:24,620
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

240
00:18:24,610 --> 00:18:28,740
because I don't see the harm in that.

241
00:18:30,490 --> 00:18:36,540
My new body opens its eyes

242
00:18:33,010 --> 00:18:36,540
and awakens from its dream.

243
00:18:36,410 --> 00:18:44,100
I have overcome many trials

244
00:18:38,530 --> 00:18:44,100
to get this body back.

245
00:18:44,050 --> 00:18:51,740
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

246
00:18:48,090 --> 00:18:51,740
I can still see.

247
00:18:51,890 --> 00:19:01,100
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

248
00:18:55,850 --> 00:19:01,100
by my own hands.

249
00:19:16,290 --> 00:19:22,500
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

250
00:19:19,010 --> 00:19:22,500
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

251
00:19:22,250 --> 00:19:30,060
With a flick of a finger,

252
00:19:23,690 --> 00:19:30,060
only my indomitable heart remains.

253
00:19:29,850 --> 00:19:39,460
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

254
00:19:35,810 --> 00:19:39,460
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

255
00:19:39,450 --> 00:19:47,300
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

256
00:19:41,970 --> 00:19:47,300
like the descent of a god.
